    "tier": 1,
    "type": "leader",
    "notes": "<h3 data-section-id=\"mb5v8a\" data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"33\">Personality</h3><p data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"387\">Jax is calm, disciplined, and relentlessly practical. He treats shadowrunning as a profession, not a lifestyle. He doesn't brag, doesn't threaten, and rarely raises his voice. He has an annoying habit of being right about risk assessments. Of the four, he's the most likely to negotiate before shooting and the most likely to shoot if negotiations fail.</p><h3 data-section-id=\"1r0j58p\" data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"405\">Scene Detail</h3><p data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"499\">Constantly checks sightlines, exits, and elevated firing positions whenever he enters a room.</p><h3 data-section-id=\"emdch2\" data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"516\">Catchphrase</h3><blockquote data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"550\"><p data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"550\">\"Let's keep this professional.\"</p></blockquote><h3 data-section-id=\"ie5x6g\" data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"562\">Accent</h3><p data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"621\">Plain American Pacific Northwest. Measured and deliberate.</p>",
